  data: {
    LLM: "Always check your Pay-off Pile card first. If it plays, play it. If not, check your hand/discards to see if you can make it play. Prioritize getting Pay-off cards out.\n\nKings Usage: Save Kings for your Pay-off card. Don't waste a King to play a mundane card from your hand unless it unblocks your Pay-off.\n\nDiscard Stacking: Organize your 4 discard piles by rank (e.g., Pile 1 strict descending, Pile 2 trash). Don't bury useful cards. Watch opponent's Pay-off cardâ€”if they need a 7, and you have a 7, hold it.",
